        rdfs:comment            "Stocking purse made by ballerina Marie Taglioni (1804-1884) for her husband, Count Gilbert de Voisins.   Croched in silk with metal decorative rings."@en , "Stocking purse croched in stripes of sand, red and brown silk, ending in self tassels, with silver star-pierced rings at either end."@en ;
